  "type": "module",
  "description": "Tracy Coffee — Tracy's EmDash template for coffee shops in the Apple-inspired OpenDesign language, with a home page that scrolls around a replaceable 3D cup (Astro SSR, Tailwind CSS 4, shadcn/ui). Demo content: the Ember Roasters café.",
